{"id": "EUVD-2026-95106", "enisaUuid": "4ce3d1c3-effd-3a14-8db6-ebb97e646d92", "description": "Pydantic AI is a Python agent framework for building applications and workflows with Generative AI. From 1.34.0 until 1.107.4 and 2.28.0, the Agent.to_web() and clai web development chat endpoint has missing request content-type validation. A website visited by a developer can submit a browser-compatible request to a loopback-hosted chat server, causing the served agent to run and execute tools with the privileges and credentials of the local process; client-relayed approval decisions also leave requires_approval=True tools exposed. Binding to localhost does not prevent a browser page from reaching the loopback address. This issue is fixed in versions 1.107.4 and 2.28.0.", "datePublished": "2026-10-08T17:02:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T17:53:29", "baseScore": 7.6, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:U/C:L/I:H/A:L", "references": ["https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/security/advisories/GHSA-h4xc-3qfq-jf93", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/pull/7382", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/pull/7383", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/commit/d2690201a1834005d382dbf5c47e0ed94ef8bf46", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/commit/dd2abbdfa029c9ad138e7cc0edd2eaeaf9ed69c0", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v1.107.4", "https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic-ai/releases/tag/v2.28.0"], "aliases": ["PYSEC-2026-4287", "CVE-2026-107295", "PYSEC-2026-4278", "GHSA-h4xc-3qfq-jf93"], "assigner": "GitHub_M", "epss": 0.16, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "85818f68-d4e4-3ccc-9135-404251846e39", "product": {"name": "pydantic-ai-slim", "vendor": {"name": "Pydantic"}}, "product_version": "1.34.0, < 1.107.4"}, {"id": "910e043a-ab0a-3c91-9d75-ad46f37bbc73", "product": {"name": "pydantic-ai", "vendor": {"name": "Pydantic"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0b1, < 2.28.0"}, {"id": "baa86d77-0187-30e0-9636-9df760f4c912", "pr